#. module: ai_agentic
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_agentic.ir_actions_server_ai_create_update_automation
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Create and update persistent automations for actions you should "
"perform later, repeatedly or in response to record event. Use this tool when "
"the user asks you to perform an action or send a reminder at a future time, "
"on a recurring schedule, or when records are created, changed, deleted, "
"messaged, or meet specified conditions.\n"
"            When creating a new automation, `name`, `description`, "
"`trigger`, `ai_action_prompt` and `explanation` are required.\n"
"            When editing an existing automation, `automation_id` and "
"`explanation` are required. For the other parameters, only provide the ones "
"that need to be updated.\n"
"            ## Trigger type\n"
"            Prefer the time-based triggers (`on_time_created`, "
"`on_time_updated`, `on_time`) over the synchronous ones (`on_create`, "
"`on_create_or_write`): they run shortly after the event instead of during "
"the user's save. \"When a ticket is created, …\" is `on_time_created` with a "
"1 minute delay; \"whenever a lead is updated, …\" is `on_time_updated`. Use "
"`on_create` / `on_create_or_write` only when the user explicitly asks for an "
"immediate, synchronous action, or for a transition on specific fields that "
"needs `filter_pre_domain`.\n"
"            ## Trigger examples\n"
"            - Tag every new ticket (preferred creation trigger): "
"`{\"trigger\": {\"type\": \"on_time_created\", \"target_model\": "
"\"helpdesk.ticket\", \"date_offset_or_interval\": {\"amount\": 1, \"unit\": "
"\"minutes\"}}}`\n"
"            - Trigger when the tag \"Bug\" is added on my tasks (a field "
"transition, hence `on_create_or_write`): `{\"trigger\": {\"type\": "
"\"on_create_or_write\", \"observed_fields\": [\"tag_ids\"], "
"\"filter_pre_domain\": \"[('tag_ids', 'not in', ['Bug'])]\", "
"\"filter_domain\": \"[('tag_ids', 'in', ['Bug']), ('user_id', '=', 3)]\"}}` "
"(if the ID of the user is 3).\n"
"            - Trigger the day before the expected closing date: "
"`{\"trigger\": {\"type\": \"on_time\", \"observed_fields\": "
"\"date_deadline\", \"date_offset_or_interval\": {\"direction\": \"before\", "
"\"amount\": 1, \"unit\": \"day\"}}}`\n"
"            - Trigger on creation if the record is unassigned: "
"`{\"trigger\": {\"type\": \"on_time_created\", \"filter_domain\": "
"\"[('user_id', '=', False)]\", \"date_offset_or_interval\": {\"amount\": 5, "
"\"unit\": \"minutes\"}}}`\n"
"            - Trigger on each Monday: `{\"trigger\": {\"type\": "
"\"on_schedule\", \"date_offset_or_interval\": {\"amount\": 7, \"unit\": "
"\"day\", \"next_trigger_date\": \"2026-08-24 09:00:00\"}}}` (if next Monday "
"is 2026-08-24)\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_agentic
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_agentic.ir_actions_server_ai_run_automation
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Runs a time-based automation right now, exactly as its schedule "
"would: spawns an duplicate of the agent that executes the actions "
"instructions in a headless run, and shows the result of it in the chat.\n"
"            Use it when the user asks to run, test or try an automation now, "
"instead of ever executing the automation's steps yourself in the "
"conversation. Only time-based automations (scheduled actions and time rules) "
"can run on demand; an event-based rule is tested by creating or updating a "
"record that matches its trigger.\n"
"            After creating a time-based automation, offer the user to run it "
"once by CALLING this tool right away: its confirmation card (\"Run\" / \"Not "
"now\") is the offer. Never ask \"should I run it?\" in your message text "
"instead, that leaves the user without the Run button.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""

#. module: ai_agentic
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_agentic
msgid ""
"\n"
"* Create and manage AI agents for various business tasks\n"
"* Integrate with popular AI models and services\n"
"* Process documents and extract information automatically\n"
"* Enhance customer service with AI-powered responses\n"
"* Automate routine tasks with intelligent workflows\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"* 多様なビジネス業務向けAIエージェントの作成・管理\n"
"* 主要なAIモデルおよびサービスとの連携\n"
"* ドキュメント処理と情報の自動抽出\n"
"* AIを活用した応答によるカスタマーサービスの強化\n"
"* インテリジェントなワークフローによる定型業務の自動化\n"

